Package: xrv-client
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: jackh0006 <jackh109867@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/jackh0006/XRV-Installer
Depends: ca-certificates
Recommends: systemd
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: XRV encrypted relay client
 XRV carries TCP traffic through an encrypted relay over ordinary Google
 HTTPS. This package installs the same relay engine as the XRV Android client,
 an authenticated local SOCKS5 proxy, Google edge probing, a live tunnel test,
 logs, and a systemd user service.
 .
 It is the Linux counterpart of the Android app's proxy-only mode. Point apps
 at the local SOCKS5 proxy, or use your system's VPN tooling for system-wide
 routing. The server installer and complete guide are in the source repository.
